#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:2 bbd9bc2b480b4eff85f3c07543a325f3
msgid "_`What each capability offers, and what it costs`"
msgstr ""
"_`每项能力的交付物与代价`"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:4 06517e1e213b4ace97e3a453006814d7
msgid ""
"The :ref:`boundaries page <What this library does not do>` says what this"
" library cannot do. The README's claim table says what is measured and "
"how it is checked. Neither answers the question the person adding an "
"algorithm actually has: *what does a capability have to come with?*"
msgstr ""
"The :ref:`边界页 <What this library does not do>` 说明本库不能做什么。"
"README 中的主张表说明测了什么、如何校验。两者都没有回答添加算法的人真正"
"的问题： *一项能力必须自带什么？*"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:8 0c03d82143454a5b84d22d93ae522f31
msgid ""
"This page is that answer, one row per capability. Six columns: the four "
"things a new capability owes, plus the two links that let the row be "
"audited."
msgstr ""
"本页就是那个答案，每项能力一行。共六列：新增能力必须交代的四件事，再加上"
"让这一行可被审计的两条链接。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:11 3654f70346ba462c89f097f585ec4b72
msgid ""
"**Diagnostic channel** -- how the capability says \"I am not measuring\","
" \"I have not converged\", \"I am holding\". A capability whose only "
"output is a number cannot be debugged in the field, because zero and \"no"
" idea\" look the same."
msgstr ""
"**诊断通道** ——能力如何表达“没有在测量”“尚未收敛”“正在保持”。只输出一个"
"数的能力在现场无法调试，因为零和“毫无信息”看起来一样。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:13 0663e1a19c1541a48eaab582f6feb33a
msgid ""
"**Admission** -- where a contradictory configuration is refused: at "
"construction or at the first step, never by silently falling back to a "
"default."
msgstr ""
"**准入** ——矛盾配置在哪里被拒绝：构造时或第一步，绝不静默退回默认值。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:15 93719b2ae7194059952dfbcbee0ccd3e
msgid ""
"**Boundary** -- the limit, pinned by a case. The cell grammar is fixed "
"and the gate enforces it: a case name in double backticks; or ``none -- "
"<reason>`` for \"no limit is known\", which therefore requires an **L3** "
"claim behind it; or ``na -- <reason>`` for \"this dimension does not "
"apply\"; or ``todo -- <reason>`` for a hole that is written down instead "
"of papered over. The gate counts the `todo` rows on every run."
msgstr ""
"**边界** ——受限之处，且由用例钉住。单元格语法固定，由门禁强制：双反引号"
"内的用例名；或 ``none -- <reason>`` 表示“未发现限制”，因此背后必须有 **"
"L3** 主张；或 ``na -- <reason>`` 表示“该维度不适用”；或 ``todo -- <"
"reason>`` 表示一个被写下来的空洞，而不是被糊过去。门禁每次运行都会统计 `"
"todo` 行。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:19 59a5f1bb9eda4d42b73aae167e67e0b4
msgid ""
"**Invariant participation** -- which case in `test_invariants.cpp` this "
"capability must obey. ``na -- <reason>`` is allowed and the reason is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"**不变量参与** ——该能力必须服从 `test_invariants.cpp` 中的哪个用例。允许"
" ``na -- <reason>`` ，但必须给出理由。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:21 3b021a96610543febdde0d16caff8341
msgid ""
"**Ledger row** -- when a capability forced a foundation correction, "
"`foundation-log.rst` says which and what it cost."
msgstr ""
"**台账行** ——当某项能力迫使基石修正时， `foundation-log.rst` 记录是哪一"
"条、代价多少。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:23 e4ff3dffdd8246bfb598be8059c5b118
msgid ""
"The `capabilities` gate checks every cell: a header under `core/` or "
"`motor/` must be listed here or named in `capability-scope.json` as "
"deliberately unlisted; every case name must exist as a `TEST()`; every "
"``none`` must have an L3 claim; every reason must actually be a reason. A"
" row that cannot be filled honestly fails the build, which is the point "
"-- the alternative is a library that grows algorithms and forgets how "
"they fail."
msgstr ""
"`capabilities` 门禁检查每个单元格： `core/` 或 `motor/` 下的头文件必须在"
"这里列出，或在 `capability-scope.json` 中声明为有意不列；每个用例名都必"
"须对应一个存在的 `TEST()` ；每个 ``none`` 都必须有 L3 主张；每条理由都必"
"须真的是理由。无法诚实填写的行会让构建失败，这正是目的——替代方案是一个不"
"断堆算法、却忘了它们如何失效的库。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:29 6b15922ce6b440678ba6a08d50172045
msgid "The three questions a criterion has to survive before it is written down"
msgstr ""
"判据落笔之前必须经受的三个问题"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:31 65d442104ed7465eac5c7e13eb0cb49b
msgid ""
"Not every one of them can be checked by a machine, which is why they live"
" here as prose rather than as a gate. Each is a defect this repository "
"has actually shipped, and each was invisible to the coverage numbers at "
"the time:"
msgstr ""
"并非每一条都能由机器检查，所以它们以文字而不是门禁的形式留在这里。每一条"
"都是本仓库实际发布过的缺陷，而且在当时都对覆盖率数字不可见："

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:35 c7972f47f72f4f3eb0c99de4c23529e5
msgid ""
"**Is it vacuously true on the rig I am actually using?** The sharpest "
"example: \"after hand-over, the angle error is within 0.05 rad in 20 ms\""
" was asserted on a *sensored* bench, where the loop uses the sensor's "
"angle -- so the error against that sensor is identically zero. The "
"criterion was green, the number was a statement about the bench rather "
"than the capability, and the fix was to delete it and state one that can "
"fail."
msgstr ""
"**它在我实际使用的台架上是否空洞地成立？** 最尖锐的例子：“交接后 20 ms"
"内角度误差在 0.05 rad 以内”是在 *带传感器* 的台架上断言的，而该台架的环"
"路用的就是这只传感器的角度——所以对这只传感器而言误差恒为零。判据是绿的，"
"那个数字说的是台架而不是能力；修法是删掉它，换成一条能够失败的判据。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:40 f731d9a8e8d14195abea69fc2912bd4a
msgid ""
"**Does it only have an upper bound?** \"must be better than X\" alone "
"pushes the next reader to tune until it passes; the honest form also "
"records where a design is *expected* to be worse. The dead-band ramp is "
"the example: it is worse than a plain ``sign()`` step on an ideal step, "
"and that has to be written into the table rather than quietly avoided "
"when tuning."
msgstr ""
"**它是否只有上界？** 只写“必须优于 X”会推着下一个读者一直调参直到过闸；"
"诚实的写法还要记录某个设计 *预期* 更差的地方。死区斜坡就是例子：在理想阶"
"跃上它比朴素的 ``sign()`` 阶跃更差，这一点必须写进表里，而不是在调参时悄"
"悄绕开。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:44 aa135530d4ae4f77bee67f9f6d92c3ef
msgid ""
"**Does the probe point distinguish the competing formula?** Before "
"claiming that a case can reject a wrong formula, evaluate both at that "
"point. ``sqrt(2ae)`` against ``sqrt(ae)`` was probed at the one place "
"where the two coincide, so the case had no teeth and nothing said so."
msgstr ""
"**探点能否区分竞争公式？** 在声称某用例能排除一个错误公式之前，先在该点"
"把两个公式都算一遍。 ``sqrt(2ae)`` 与 ``sqrt(ae)`` 的探点恰好取在两者重"
"合的那一处，于是用例没有牙齿，而且没有任何东西指出这一点。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:49 e8d9225fbb7741c1a1c12fb92eaade67
msgid "Capabilities that are a procedure rather than a formula"
msgstr ""
"以流程而非公式形态出现的能力"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:51 e5548a498b404139be3de24e26b99c1b
msgid ""
"Some of what this library offers is not a law but a *procedure*: "
"identification of the machine (``commissioning.hpp``), speed-loop tuning "
"(``auto_tune.hpp``), learning the cogging table (``cogging_learn.hpp``). "
"Their criterion is not a constant that could be written into an "
"assertion, so the row records what the procedure owes instead:"
msgstr ""
"本库提供的东西里，有一部分不是定律而是 *流程* ：电机辨识（ ``"
"commissioning.hpp`` ）、速度环整定（ ``auto_tune.hpp`` ）、齿槽表学习（ "
"``cogging_learn.hpp`` ）。它们的判据不是能写进断言的常数，所以行里记录的"
"是流程必须交代什么："

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:56 1d7deb7210804509bd852c9701ce3177
msgid ""
"**It says when it cannot answer.** ``valid == false`` plus a reason, "
"never a number produced from data that does not describe this machine. A "
"procedure that only answers on good data cannot be claimed for any data."
msgstr ""
"**它会说明自己何时无法作答。** ``valid == false`` 加一条理由，绝不用并不"
"描述这台电机的数据产出一个数。只在好数据上作答的流程，不能对任何数据作出"
"主张。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:58 e1b2a7775d6245a1b5429dce3e6f5561
msgid ""
"**It states the band it is valid in**, in the units the caller measures "
"-- a speed band, a window length, a number of revolutions -- and the band"
" is pinned by a case rather than described in prose."
msgstr ""
"**它声明自己有效的区间** ，用调用方测量的单位表示——转速区间、窗口长度、"
"圈数——且该区间由用例钉住，而不是用文字描述。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:60 66d6f8439f58419b9d5fee9604259008
msgid ""
"**Its objective is a held-out margin, never accuracy.** A procedure "
"optimised for \"smaller error\" produces a criterion fitted to the model "
"it was scored on; the number worth publishing is the distance to failure,"
" measured on machines that took no part in the fit."
msgstr ""
"**它的目标函数是留出裕度，绝非精度。** 以“更小误差”为优化目标的流程，产"
"出的判据是对它被打分所用模型的拟合；值得公布的数字是失效距离，并且要在没"
"有参与拟合的电机上测量。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:64 5e68125a5e29465a87c483a5771a9337
msgid ""
"Such a capability reaches **L2** when the procedure is reproducible and "
"its refusals are reachable, and that is the whole of what \"a procedure\""
" buys. **L3** still needs the same two things every other row needs -- "
"item-by-item sensitivity and an independent cross-check, e.g. the same "
"procedure replayed on a second plant -- so a procedure is not a shortcut "
"past the evidence levels, and it never reaches L4 without hardware."
msgstr ""
"当流程可复现、其拒绝路径可达时，这样的能力达到 **L2** ，这也就是“流程”形"
"态能换到的全部。 **L3** 仍需要其他每一行都需要的那两件事——逐项敏感性与独"
"立交叉校验，例如把同一流程在第二台被控对象上重放——所以流程不是绕过证据等"
"级的捷径，而且没有硬件就永远到不了 L4。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:69 6b29a8d975fb4df0830976afc0fcf7c7
msgid ""
"**The three obligations are executable rather than aspirational.** "
"``test_sop_outer_loop.cpp`` drives the outer-loop procedure end to end --"
" identify, propose, measure, held-out acceptance -- on two machines of "
"different inertia, and records the objective as a **distance to failure**"
" (``tolerance - |j_identified/j_nameplate - 1|``), a number that changes "
"sign exactly where the library refuses. A gain fitted on the wrong "
"machine is caught in both directions by a band whose two edges are "
"themselves measured (the gain law's own residual, and the smallest "
"nameplate error the repo calls actionable). The three red proofs were run"
" and are recorded with the numbers: replacing the held-out machine with a"
" copy of the fitted one, deleting the refusal path, and collapsing the "
"parameter search to a single setting each turn exactly the expected case "
"red. With that, the replay-on-a-second-machine half of **L3** is in place"
" for this procedure; the sensitivity half is not, so the row stays "
"**L2**."
msgstr ""
"**三项义务是可执行的，而非愿望。** ``test_sop_outer_loop.cpp`` 在惯性不"
"同的两台电机上端到端跑通外环流程——辨识、提出、测量、留出验收——并把目标函"
"数记录为 **失效距离** （ ``tolerance - |j_identified/j_nameplate - 1|`` "
"），这个数恰好在库拒绝的地方改变符号。拟合错电机得到的增益会被区间从两个"
"方向同时抓住，而该区间的两端本身也是测出来的（增益律自身的残差，以及仓库"
"认为值得动作的最小铭牌误差）。三次红证都已运行，并连同数字一起记录：把留"
"出电机换成被拟合电机的副本、删除拒绝路径、把参数搜索压成单一设置，每一次"
"都恰好让预期用例变红。至此，本流程的 **L3** 中“在第二台电机上重放”那一半"
"已经就位；敏感性那一半还没有，所以这一行仍是 **L2** 。"

