"``configure()`` 拒绝非正的截止频率或步长。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:113 f299fc0cae474ad7a14650584afbd7e1
msgid ""
"na -- a first-order filter is exact for its stated cutoff; the limit that"
" matters belongs to the loop around it, not to the filter."
msgstr ""
"na ——一阶滤波器对其声明的截止频率是精确的；要紧的限制属于它外层的环，而"
"不属于滤波器。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:115 93416293fd80449581227f9ce0c63535
msgid ""
"na -- linear and time-invariant; the invariants that bite are on the loop"
" around it, not on it."
msgstr ""
"na ——线性时不变；真正起作用的不变量在它外层的环上，不在它自身。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:117 a847d59c43b7484fafe842c875655bb9
msgid "``core/protection.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/protection.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:118 c231d0a5a1aa4c22bb28ad7f39a498e5
msgid ""
"``thermal_budget()``, ``derated_limit()``, ``fault_is_latched()`` -- "
"\"fine\", \"derating\" and \"stopped\" are three readable numbers rather "
"than one code. The split is by definition and not by accident: "
"`output_allowed` is `active_mask == 0`, so a fault in this library "
"*means* \"authority removed\", and derating -- the axis still running at "
"reduced authority -- is announced by `i_limit_a` falling below the "
"configured `i_max_a`. `FaultCode` names the mechanism, and the newest one"
" (`DriveFault`) is the only cause that does not come from the protector "
"at all: it is the power stage telling on itself, read at the top of the "
"tick and appended to the enum so every existing number keeps its meaning."
msgstr ""
"``thermal_budget()`` 、 ``derated_limit()`` 、 ``fault_is_latched()`` ——"
"“正常”“降额”“停机”是三个可读的数，而不是一个状态码。这个划分是定义使然，"
"不是巧合： `output_allowed` 就是 `active_mask == 0` ，所以本库中的故障 *"
"意味着* “权限被收回”；而降额——轴仍在以降低后的权限运行——由 `i_limit_a` "
"低于配置的 `i_max_a` 来宣告。 `FaultCode` 命名机理，其中最新的一项（ `"
"DriveFault` ）是唯一完全不是来自保护器的成因：它是功率级对自己的告发，在"
"tick 开头读取，并追加到枚举末尾，使每个既有编号保持原意。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:125 240ad74ae00d46f39c89fff2ab7f1381
