#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:136 ffe7be7c4e26451cb8f47be0350126bc
msgid ""
"``size()``, ``dropped()``, ``latest()`` -- a full ring keeps recording "
"and counts what it overwrote, so \\\"I lost the window\\\" is a number "
"rather than an absence. ``t_us == 0`` on every sample means the platform "
"has no clock, which is a fact about the HAL and not a claim that "
"everything happened at once."
msgstr ""
"``size()`` 、 ``dropped()`` 、 ``latest()`` ——环形缓冲写满后仍继续记录，"
"并统计覆盖了多少，于是“窗口丢了”是一个数，而不是一片空白。每个样本的 ``"
"t_us== 0`` 说明平台没有时钟，这是关于 HAL 的事实，而不是“一切都发生在同"
"一时刻”的主张。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:139 2d02d4433b4946c3bdf7b62369755585
