#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:161 f5b1c0b38b8b49e182f39434dd6c4a43
msgid "``core/friction_comp.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/friction_comp.hpp`` （摩擦补偿）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:162 95b26fb63cda4686a913e5dd963f9b86
msgid ""
"``at_rest`` and `stalled` -- and the fact that the output is a *constant*"
" at rest rather than a square wave. A Coulomb term on `sign(measured "
"speed)` ripples by twice the term where the stage is needed most; the "
"latch is what turns that into a number an axis can hold. `stalled` "
"separates \"holding a load\" from \"going nowhere\", which the position "
"signal cannot."
msgstr ""
"``at_rest`` 与 `stalled` ——以及静止时输出是 *常量* 而非方波这一事实。基"
"于 `sign(measured speed)` 的库仑项会在最需要这一级的工况上以两倍该项的幅"
"度纹波；锁存把它变成一个轴能保持住的数。 `stalled` 把“顶住负载”与“原地不"
"动”分开，位置信号做不到这一点。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:166 1692c4fbc7a64b3b88455a864de0b00a
msgid ""
"`Param` when the estimate describes a machine that cannot exist -- "
"kinetic friction above breakaway, a negative coefficient, a non-finite "
"value -- and in that case nothing is added at all, rather than a smaller "
"guess."
msgstr ""
"当估计值描述一台不可能存在的电机时返回 `Param` ——动摩擦高于脱开摩擦、系"
"数为负、值非有限——此时完全不叠加任何量，而不是给一个更小的猜测。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:168 06ba7ac9c02a43ff8666369dea45e9e5
msgid "``FrictionComp.AnEstimateAboveTheBreakawayWalksTheAxisWithNoCommandAtAll``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"FrictionComp.AnEstimateAboveTheBreakawayWalksTheAxisWithNoCommandAtAll``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:169 3bcb1bbdd8bd48f19028ccda24794677
msgid ""
"na -- no time constant and no integration; the only state is the latched "
"direction, and the cases check that it survives a re-tune."
msgstr ""
"na ——无时间常数、无积分；唯一的状态是锁存的方向，用例检查它能挺过一次重"
"新整定。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:171 90020b9b03704cada19bd5c15d81dba4
msgid "A-18, A-19, C-9"
msgstr ""
"A-18, A-19, C-9"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:172 a17cad4a1b2d467588e303bc8403b24a
msgid "``core/hall.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/hall.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:173 4a2b2e9ad0334666b4c6d72cef441c44
msgid ""
"``status()`` -- three answers rather than one number: `Fault` when the "
"code is 0 or 7 (the two a three-bit field leaves over), `State` when the "
"interval between edges stopped looking like a sector, `Ok` otherwise -- "
"plus `illegal_reads()`/`stale_reads()`, which say which channel fired. A "
"code-only decoder cannot know how wrong it is; these say whether it is "
"measuring at all."
msgstr ""
"``status()`` ——三个答案而不是一个数：码为 0 或 7（三位字段多出来的那两个"
"）时是 `Fault` ，边沿间隔不再像一个扇区时是 `State` ，其余为 `Ok` ；另有"
" `illegal_reads()` /`stale_reads()` 说明是哪一路触发。只解码码值的实现无"
"法知道自己偏了多少；这些量说明它到底还在不在测量。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:177 a7c1eade00f34aa4ae71b16c621203d4
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`Param` on a non-finite timestamp; an illegal code answers a zero vector "
"and `Fault` rather than a guessed vector, and an interval that leaves "
"`[period/1.5, period*1.5]` is refused rather than adopted as the new "
"reference -- adopting it is what a dead sensor needs to stay hidden "
"(measured: 36 % of a revolution reporting `Ok` with a 120-degree error, "
"against 8.4 % once refused)."
msgstr ""
"时间戳非有限时返回 `Param` ；非法码返回零矢量与 `Fault` ，而不是猜一个矢"
"量；落在 `[period/1.5, period*1.5]` 之外的间隔被拒绝，而不是被采纳为新的"
"基准——一旦采纳，坏掉的传感器就能一直藏着（实测：一圈中有 36 % 的时间报 `"
"Ok` 且带 120 度误差；改为拒绝后是 8.4 %）。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:181 71e4872fb86644598d9245ed8e23f608
msgid "``HallTracker.AStuckSensorIsCoveredByTwoChannelsAndNeitherAloneIsEnough``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"HallTracker.AStuckSensorIsCoveredByTwoChannelsAndNeitherAloneIsEnough``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:182 41d05bbbbed34e7b9d5f63f72ab0e22d
msgid ""
"na -- a per-sample decoder; the only cross-frame state is the sector "
"period, and a doubtful one is kept rather than taken."
msgstr ""
"na ——逐样本解码器；唯一的跨帧状态是扇区周期，可疑的值只保留、不采纳。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:184 2bce90bbd7f945bf8108f9858b94aca6
