#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:185 cc41aceb5dad4548ac270b0bbfdfca26
msgid "``core/brake_chopper.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/brake_chopper.hpp`` （制动斩波器）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:186 db2e3ac34c474405b23f2250198f3ea7
msgid ""
"`BrakeChopperOutput`: `duty`, the **period-average** `current_a`, "
"`i2t_a2s` (the integral of the **mean square** current, which is not the "
"square of that average -- they differ by `1/duty_max`), `on`, and the "
"latched `budget_exceeded`. In SIL the same quantities are readable a "
"second way, from the bus: `r*i2t` and the energy the meter books against "
"the resistor agree to 0.045 %."
msgstr ""
"`BrakeChopperOutput` ： `duty` 、 **周期平均** 的 `current_a` 、 `"
"i2t_a2s` （ **均方** 电流的积分，它不等于该平均值的平方——两者相差 `"
"1/duty_max` ）、 `on` ，以及锁存的 `budget_exceeded` 。在 SIL 中同一组量"
"还有第二种读法，从母线读： `r*i2t` 与电能表记在电阻上的能量一致到 0.045"
"%。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:190 47ac3f04b19d4801bf4b9017fc9b02f4
msgid ""
"`Param` for a chopper that cannot act (a zero resistor, an inverted band,"
" a zero duty) and for a period of zero, in both cases **without** "
"changing any state; a spent budget latches rather than resuming."
msgstr ""
"斩波器无法动作（电阻为零、区间反向、占空比为零）时，以及周期为零时返回 `"
"Param` ；两种情况都 **不** 改动任何状态。耗尽的预算会锁存，而不是恢复。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:192 c3d0aa991d4041a799cdea63a5dab0e0
msgid "``SilBrakeChopper.TheChopperHoldsTheBusAndTheBooksClose``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``SilBrakeChopper.TheChopperHoldsTheBusAndTheBooksClose``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:193 98d2a8b5bee84c1b85d92e24c1841a4e
msgid ""
"na -- the bounds and the current law are asserted in the capability's own"
" case, swept across the bus range with the wrong law computed alongside; "
"the invariants suite is for statements that must hold whatever "
"composition is selected, and a chopper is not on a composition axis."
msgstr ""
"na ——边界与电流律在该能力自己的用例中断言，扫过整个母线范围，并把错误电"
"流律并行算出来对照；不变量套件针对的是无论选中哪种组合都必须成立的陈述，"
"而斩波器不在任何组合轴上。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:195 cc7a01073d574fec9a8bdb3e84d44772
msgid "``core/min_pulse.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/min_pulse.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:196 e65d0aeecb664f54a3fa583a523fb91e
msgid ""
"`MinPulseOutput` carries `duty` (what to command), `lost_vs` (the volt-"
"seconds the bridge will not deliver, signed and per phase) and "
"`narrowed`; the residue is readable through `carry()`, which is what lets"
" a trace tell \"the loop is asking for something the driver refuses\" "
"from \"the loop is fine\"."
msgstr ""
"`MinPulseOutput` 携带 `duty` （要下发的占空比）、 `lost_vs` （桥臂不会送"
"出的伏秒，带符号、逐相）与 `narrowed` ；残差可通过 `carry()` 读出，这正"
"是让轨迹能区分“环路在索要驱动拒绝给出的东西”与“环路正常”的地方。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:199 7940a29bc4ad43b6aa2f8cf7ac531b15
msgid ""
"`Param` for a limit that cannot *be* a limit (`2*t_min > T`, a negative "
"limit, a zero period), for a bus voltage that is not a voltage, and never"
" by moving the residue: a refused call changes no state, so a bad "
"configuration cannot quietly bias the average it is supposed to correct."
msgstr ""
"限值根本无法 *成为* 限值时（ `2*t_min > T` 、限值为负、周期为零）返回 `"
"Param` ，母线电压不是一个电压时亦然；并且绝不通过挪动残差来表示拒绝：被"
"拒绝的调用不改动任何状态，坏的配置因而无法悄悄偏置它本该修正的平均值。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:202 f01ff700a7a941e4a083c71c47c86a80
msgid "``SilMinPulse.ThePlantTransmitsWhatTheDriverAllowsAndThePolicyKnowsThePrice``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"SilMinPulse.ThePlantTransmitsWhatTheDriverAllowsAndThePolicyKnowsThePrice"
"``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:203 990a859f98d94d1696aeb448db3dad4b
msgid ""
"na -- a per-period policy whose only state is one residue, bounded by one"
" minimum pulse and asserted as such; it produces no continuous output for"
" the invariants suite to hold."
msgstr ""
"na ——逐周期策略，唯一状态是一个残差，被一个最小脉宽界住并有断言为证；它"
"不产生让不变量套件去约束的连续输出。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:206 ccd15301a48a4b0ab0b1e09599d93555
msgid "``core/single_shunt.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/single_shunt.hpp`` （单电阻采样）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:207 ce05bf5a995a45a5b7e95e3813b85c2a
msgid ""
"`ShuntVerdict` has three answers, not a boolean: `Measurable`, "
"`WindowTooNarrow` (this period cannot be read, the reference is near a "
"sector boundary) and `NoActiveVector` (nothing flows through the shunt at"
" all, so nothing is missed), plus `ShuntWindow.window_s` / `needed_s`, "
"which say how far from the edge the period was. A refused reconstruction "
"returns `valid == false` **and** zeros, so a caller that checks only the "
"numbers sees a motor drawing no current -- which is why the flag exists."
msgstr ""
"`ShuntVerdict` 有三个答案，不是一个布尔量： `Measurable` 、 `"
"WindowTooNarrow` （本周期读不到，参考矢量靠近扇区边界）与 `"
"NoActiveVector` （根本没有电流流过采样电阻，所以也没有漏掉什么）；另有 `"
"ShuntWindow.window_s` / `needed_s` 说明本周期离边缘有多远。被拒绝的重构"
"返回 `valid == false` **以及** 全零，所以只检查数值的调用方会看到一台不"
"取电流的电机——标志位存在的理由就是这一点。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:212 9116dce6a14743c5ba48e383266c4748
msgid ""
"`Param` for a configuration that can never read anything "
"(`2*(t_settle+t_sample) >= T`), for a non-finite timing and for a duty "
"outside `[0, 1]`; a period outside the window is **not** a `Param` -- it "
"is `Ok` with `valid == false`, because a narrow window is the normal "
"operating condition and not a configuration error."
msgstr ""
"永远读不到任何东西的配置（ `2*(t_settle+t_sample) >= T` ）、非有限的时序"
"、以及落在 `[0, 1]` 之外的占空比返回 `Param` ；而落在窗口之外的周期 **不"
"是** `Param` ——那是 `Ok` 加 `valid == false` ，因为窗口过窄是正常工况，"
"不是配置错误。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:215 626690e5ee4e46aaaeba62d43d276cdd
msgid "``SingleShunt.TheBlindSpotIsLowModulationNotTheVoltageLimit``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``SingleShunt.TheBlindSpotIsLowModulationNotTheVoltageLimit``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:216 0431ca4c86db4b07abffaff3c7b9dacc
msgid ""
"na -- stateless, one period at a time, and the thing it holds is a "
"verdict rather than an accumulated value."
msgstr ""
"na ——无状态，一次一个周期；它持有的是判决，而不是累积值。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:218 f13f439b88c1436284d687682bede60a
msgid "``core/mtpv.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/mtpv.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:219 3e039a26b36a48ca91f0b433e32b67f3
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`MtpvPoint` names which ceiling decided the point: `voltage_limited` is "
"true only when the voltage ellipse moved the answer, and `current_a` is "
"the margin to the current ceiling, so a host can tell \"the voltage is "
"what limits me\" from \"the current is\". `base_speed_rad_s()` is derived"
" (`v_max` over the flux magnitude at the current-limited point), not "
"`v_max/psi_f` -- on the in-domain profile the two differ by 4x, 725 "
"against 2520 rad/s. The boundary case is the band where *both* ceilings "
"are active at once (725 to 1191 rad/s there): a single-constraint law "
"reports that band as 30 % over the voltage ceiling, which is what the "
"case asserts."
msgstr ""
"`MtpvPoint` 指明是哪一个上限决定了该工作点：只有电压椭圆改变了答案时 `"
"voltage_limited` 才为真， `current_a` 是到电流上限的裕度，于是上位机可以"
"区分“电压在限制我”与“电流在限制我”。 `base_speed_rad_s()` 是推导量（ `"
"v_max` 除以电流受限点上的磁链幅值），而非 `v_max/psi_f` ——在域内型面上两"
"者相差 4 倍，725 对 2520 rad/s。边界用例就是两个上限 *同时* 生效的那一段"
"（在那里是 725 到 1191 rad/s）：单约束律会报该段超出电压上限 30 %，用例"
"断言的正是这一点。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:225 488b569f21ff4111ab32348d1fb39295
msgid ""
"`Param` for a ceiling that is not positive, a non-positive inductance, a "
"negative flux linkage, zero pole pairs and anything non-finite, and "
"`Param` from `at_speed()` for a speed that is not finite. There is no "
"\"no answer\" case above zero speed: the `i_q = 0` point on the ellipse "
"is always inside the current circle, so the candidate set is never empty "
"and a zero-torque point is returned rather than a failure."
msgstr ""
"上限非正、电感非正、磁链为负、极对数为零以及任何非有限量都返回 `Param` "
"； `at_speed()` 对非有限转速也返回 `Param` 。零速以上不存在“无解”的情形"
"：椭圆上的 `i_q = 0` 点总在电流圆内，因此候选集永不为空，返回的是零转矩"
"点而不是失败。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:229 f0610d6b4b5c43648ff70eae3f2c1b85
msgid "``Mtpv.StayingOnTheCurrentLimitThereWouldOvervoltTheDrive``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``Mtpv.StayingOnTheCurrentLimitThereWouldOvervoltTheDrive``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:230 c50c4f715be6488c8f8dd0cf96111ce9
msgid ""
"na -- stateless, one speed at a time, and what it produces is an "
"operating point rather than an accumulated value."
msgstr ""
"na ——无状态，一次一个转速；它产出的是工作点，而不是累积值。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:232 0e991adc12ea4ff796596bee56a214de
msgid "``core/cogging_comp.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/cogging_comp.hpp`` （齿槽补偿）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:233 779b7b2b4592427fabc2dc3743677ae2
msgid ""
"`CoggingCompOutput` separates the two ways a compensator can stop "
"working: `gain` is the frequency fade (\"we chose not to ask for this "
"ripple\") and `clipped` is the current ceiling (\"we asked and it was "
"refused\"), with `torque_nm` carrying the cancelled torque before either "
"limit. A compensator that reports only its output current cannot be told "
"apart from one that is silently doing nothing."
msgstr ""
"`CoggingCompOutput` 区分补偿器停止生效的两种方式： `gain` 是频率淡出（“"
"有意不索取这份纹波”）， `clipped` 是电流上限（“索取过，被拒绝”），而 `"
"torque_nm` 携带两种限制生效之前的被抵消转矩。只报告输出电流的补偿器，与"
"一个静默地什么都不做的补偿器无法区分。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:237 62f2efa3e3d74ea199e6b5132de6aeeb
msgid ""
"`Param` for a machine that cannot produce torque at the `id` it is given "
"(`dT/diq = 0` at the flux-nulling current, where no current can cancel a "
"torque), for any non-finite input, and for a fade band that is inverted "
"or non-finite. A table of nothing is `Ok` with a zero offset -- there is "
"no table, so there is no decision to report."
msgstr ""
"电机在给定的 `id` 下无法产生转矩时（在磁链归零电流处 `dT/diq = 0` ，那里"
"任何电流都无法抵消转矩）、任何非有限输入、以及反向或非有限的淡出区间都返"
"回 `Param` 。空表返回 `Ok` 加零偏移——没有表，也就没有决策可报告。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:240 d785d2674b0345faa1c827a1afa6faa7
msgid "``CoggingComp.ATableWithTheWrongPhaseCancelsNothingAtAll``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``CoggingComp.ATableWithTheWrongPhaseCancelsNothingAtAll``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:241 1322257c4d08418e86f993e3b2e315a9
msgid ""
"na -- stateless, one period at a time, and what it produces is an offset "
"rather than an accumulated value."
msgstr ""
"na ——无状态，一次一个周期；它产出的是偏移量，而不是累积值。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:243 ba68984aa3a444688a32cfc75cf8c71f
msgid "``core/cogging_learn.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/cogging_learn.hpp`` （齿槽表学习）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:244 576a3bb2e4f5498fa92b35f95f4af76c
msgid ""
"`CoggingLearnReport` reports `revolutions` and the speed band on "
"**every** exit, including the refused ones: a refusal that says nothing "
"leaves the caller guessing whether to spin longer, slower, or steadier, "
"and those are three different actions. A table it never saw is absent "
"from the output rather than extrapolated, because a compensator acting on"
" an invented harmonic injects a ripple of its own. **Reachable from C "
"since 0.1.9** (six `experimental` entries: "
"`foc_cogging_learn_create/accumulate/ready/finish/reset/destroy`), so a "
"script can learn a machine's table. What this answer is, is a **table**, "
"so the C contract carries a capacity clause the C++ one does not need: "
"`finish()` echoes `required` (how many entries the answer needs) and "
"`capacity` (how many the caller offered) on **every** return, and given "
"too few slots it refuses with `FOC_ERR_PARAM` instead of writing a "
"shorter table -- a truncated table tells the caller it asked for fewer "
"orders, and the harmonics it is missing are exactly the ones nobody kept "
"a record of. Passing `out_table == NULL` asks for the report alone: "
"`FOC_OK` with `count == 0` then means *the window is a measurement and "
"there was nowhere to put it*, which the C++ signature cannot say, because"
" there `nullptr` with `capacity == 0` is just another refusal. A short "
"buffer is the caller's defect and answers `FOC_ERR_PARAM`; the window's "
"own refusals stay `FOC_ERR_STATE`, and both are reported: the buffer "
"verdict wins the return code because it is the one the caller can fix "
"without changing the physics, and `result.status` still names the "
"window's verdict underneath."
msgstr ""
"`CoggingLearnReport` 在 **每一次** 退出时都报告 `revolutions` 与转速区间"
"，包括被拒绝的那几次：什么都不说的拒绝把调用方留在猜测里——该多转一会、转"
"慢一点，还是转得更均匀，这是三种不同的动作。它从未见到的表会从输出中缺席"
"，而不是被外推，因为作用于凭空发明出来的谐波的补偿器会注入自己的纹波。 *"
"*自 0.1.9 起可从 C 调用** （六个 `experimental` 入口： `"
"foc_cogging_learn_create/accumulate/ready/finish/reset/destroy` ），因此"
"脚本也能学习一台电机的表。这个答案本身是一张 **表** ，所以 C 契约带有一"
"条C++ 契约不需要的容量条款： `finish()` 在 **每一次** 返回时都会回显 `"
"required` （答案需要多少条目）与 `capacity` （调用方提供了多少），槽位不"
"足时它以 `FOC_ERR_PARAM` 拒绝，而不是写出更短的表——被截断的表等于告诉调"
"用方它只索取了更少的阶次，而缺掉的那些谐波恰恰是没有人做过记录的部分。传"
"入 `out_table == NULL` 表示只要报告：此时 `FOC_OK` 加 `count == 0` 的含"
"义是 *窗口是一次测量，而无处安放* ，这是 C++ 签名无法表达的，因为在那里 "
"`nullptr` 配 `capacity == 0` 只是又一次拒绝。缓冲区过短是调用方的缺陷，"
"答以 `FOC_ERR_PARAM` ；窗口自身的拒绝仍是 `FOC_ERR_STATE` ，两者都会报告"
"：缓冲区判决赢下返回码，因为它是调用方无需改动物理就能修好的那个，而 `"
"result.status` 在下面仍会指出窗口的判决。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:260 936199cd25164f7a96719094eed6d409
msgid ""
"`State` for fewer revolutions than configured, `|omega|` outside `[min, "
"max]` either side, a window whose speed spread exceeds `speed_tolerance`,"
" a saturated sample anywhere in it, and a destination with no room for "
"the table; `Param` for order 0 (a constant torque is a load, not "
"cogging), an inverted or non-finite band, a non-finite tolerance, and "
"unusable machine parameters. Nothing was written in any of those cases."
msgstr ""
"以下情形返回 `State` ：圈数少于配置值， `|omega|` 越出 `[min, max]` 的任"
"一侧，窗口内转速离散度超过 `speed_tolerance` ，窗口内任一处样本饱和，目"
"标缓冲区放不下这张表。以下情形返回 `Param` ：阶次为 0（恒定转矩是负载，"
"不是齿槽），区间反向或非有限，容差非有限，电机参数不可用。以上每一种情形"
"都没有写入任何东西。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:264 2343842146e54ea7aeb220075ab1ba45
msgid "``CoggingLearn.TheLearnedTableCancelsTheInjectionItWasLearnedFrom``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``CoggingLearn.TheLearnedTableCancelsTheInjectionItWasLearnedFrom``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:265 bc9589a4bdda40a781bde502a885ea1f
msgid ""
"na -- the accumulators are sums over a finite window that is thrown away "
"on `reset()`, and what leaves the class is a table rather than a per-tick"
" output."
msgstr ""
"na ——累加器是有限窗口上的求和，该窗口在 `reset()` 时被丢弃；离开这个类的"
"是一张表，而不是逐 tick 的输出。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:268 0c351d9b44d941c7bdbe029aac8423a3
msgid "``core/thermal_limit.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/thermal_limit.hpp`` （热限额）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:269 d4724f8d567a4b30bdbd4f0af6263a6c
msgid ""
"`ThermalBudget` separates \"this current can be held forever\" from "
"\"this current can be held for five more seconds\" instead of reporting "
"one number for both: `crosses == false` with `seconds` infinite is the "
"sustainable answer, and collapsing the two is how a scheduler throttles a"
" machine that was never in trouble. `ThermalLimitReport` reports "
"`settle_at_cont_c` so the assumption behind the continuous current is "
"visible rather than implied."
msgstr ""
"`ThermalBudget` 把“这一电流可以一直保持”与“这一电流还能再保持五秒”分开，"
"而不是用一个数同时回答两者： `crosses == false` 且 `seconds` 为无穷，是"
"可长期维持的答案；把两者合并成一个数，正是调度器对一台从未出过问题的电机"
"做降额的方式。 `ThermalLimitReport` 报告 `settle_at_cont_c` ，使连续电流"
"背后的假设可见，而不是隐含。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:273 252b1bef7a214e5090d068377adbd869
msgid ""
"`Param` for `rt <= 0` (no cooling path), `rs <= 0` (no copper to heat), a"
" negative `alpha` (a winding that cools as it heats is not a model), and "
"a reserve that is not above ambient (no current can heat the winding down"
" to it). A missing `Ct` is *not* an error: the continuous current does "
"not need it, and only the budget then reports that it cannot name a time."
msgstr ""
"`rt <= 0` （没有散热路径）、 `rs <= 0` （没有铜可发热）、 `alpha` 为负（"
"越热越冷的绕组不是模型）、以及预留温度不高于环境温度（没有任何电流能把绕"
"组加热到该温度）时返回 `Param` 。缺少 `Ct` *不是* 错误：连续电流不需要它"
"，此时只有预算会报告自己说不出一个时间。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:277 018a254e402e41ba9cf92911ce62741f
msgid "``ThermalLimit.TheNaiveLawReadsFifteenPercentHighAndThePlantSaysSo``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``ThermalLimit.TheNaiveLawReadsFifteenPercentHighAndThePlantSaysSo`"
"`"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:278 ef58d0722cf24b28960b324f5014aa40
msgid ""
"na -- stateless: every answer is a closed form of the configuration and "
"its arguments, and nothing is accumulated."
msgstr ""
"na ——无状态：每个答案都是配置与其参数的闭式表达，没有任何量被累加。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:280 8baabb845e57422d924c523bbd2c7cd6
msgid "``core/watchdog.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/watchdog.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:281 5bd3f4c45825493c9991b1b1c95e3ab4
msgid ""
"`WatchdogState` separates the four answers a feeder can leave behind: "
"`Feeding` (inside the window), `Expired` (the window passed), `ClockLost`"
" (the stamp went backwards) and `Unarmed` (nothing measured yet). The "
"last two are the point: `Unarmed` is reported as a `State` error and "
"never as `Ok`, because a watchdog nobody feeds protects nothing, and "
"`ClockLost` is a separate state from `Expired` because the verdict is the"
" same (stop) and the diagnosis is not. A latched report repeats the "
"numbers that caused the latch instead of growing with the clock."
msgstr ""
"`WatchdogState` 区分喂狗方可能留下的四种答案： `Feeding` （在窗口内）、 "
"`Expired` （窗口已过）、 `ClockLost` （时间戳倒退）与 `Unarmed` （尚未测"
"量过）。后两者才是要点： `Unarmed` 报为 `State` 错误，绝不报为 `Ok` ，因"
"为没人喂的看门狗什么也保护不了； `ClockLost` 与 `Expired` 是两个独立状态"
"，因为判决相同（停机），诊断不同。锁存之后的报告重复导致锁存的那组数，而"
"不是随时钟增长。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:286 6a6194d18982493a8a8932305af2a216
msgid ""
"`Param` for a zero window (it would trip on every feeder and stop a drive"
" for a reason nobody can act on) and for a kick before any window was "
"accepted -- and a refused window changes nothing, including a latch. "
"`State` for a poll or kick before the first kick, and for a kick after a "
"latch (it does not re-arm and is not counted as a feed). `Fault` once "
"expired or clock-lost."
msgstr ""
"窗口为零（它会对每个喂狗方跳闸，并以一个无人能应对的理由停掉驱动）、以及"
"在任何窗口被接受之前就喂狗时返回 `Param` ——被拒绝的窗口不改动任何东西，"
"包括锁存。第一次喂狗之前轮询或喂狗、以及锁存之后再喂狗（它不会重新武装，"
"也不计为一次喂狗）返回 `State` 。已过期或时钟丢失后返回 `Fault` 。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:290 1a5eacdaed1d4159bc3bf47fee436548
msgid "``Watchdog.TheDeadlineIsExactForEveryWholeNumberOfControlPeriods``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``Watchdog.TheDeadlineIsExactForEveryWholeNumberOfControlPeriods``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:291 0d43a4f3e0d4425d95ea8e7d81fabc8f
msgid ""
"na -- it holds one timestamp and one latch, neither of which is a "
"continuous-output invariant; the latch is pinned by "
"`Watchdog.AFeederThatComesBackDoesNotClearTheTrip`, which is a sequence "
"rather than a per-tick property."
msgstr ""
"na ——它持有一个时间戳和一个锁存，两者都不是连续输出上的不变量；锁存由 `"
"Watchdog.AFeederThatComesBackDoesNotClearTheTrip` 钉住，那是一条序列，而"
"不是逐 tick 的性质。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:294 67f2536ee2dc49b2aa7472738941e37d
msgid "``core/auto_tune.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/auto_tune.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:295 b2c24910b8844fc0a5efe82e115fcb8c
msgid ""
"`SpeedTuneResult` separates \"here are gains measured from this machine\""
" from \"I could not measure this machine\": `valid` is the bit, and on a "
"refusal the gains it carries are the **nameplate** ones, so a caller that"
" applies whatever it gets applies nothing new. `reason` names which of "
"seven refusals fired, because \"spin with a varying current\" and "
"\"something is pulling on the axis\" are different actions. The fit keeps"
" an **intercept** so a constant unknown load cannot be attributed to the "
"current. **Reachable from C since 0.1.9** (five `experimental` entries: "
"`foc_autotune_create/accumulate/finish/reset/destroy`), so a C or Python "
"consumer can run the procedure. A session is its own opaque handle rather"
" than a motor register -- nothing is readable tick by tick, only a window"
" to feed and an answer to ask for -- and `finish()` answering `FOC_OK` "
"with `valid == 0` is a refusal, not a failure."
msgstr ""
"`SpeedTuneResult` 把“这些是从这台电机上测得的增益”与“这台电机我测不了”分"
"开： `valid` 就是那一位，被拒绝时它携带的是 **铭牌** 增益，于是照单全收"
"的调用方不会应用任何新东西。 `reason` 指明七种拒绝中哪一条触发，因为“带"
"变化的电流转起来”与“有东西在拉这根轴”是两种不同的动作。拟合保留一个 **截"
"距** ，使恒定的未知负载不会被归到电流上。 **自 0.1.9 起可从 C 调用** （"
"五个 `experimental` 入口： `"
"foc_autotune_create/accumulate/finish/reset/destroy` ），因此 C 或Python"
" 调用方也能跑这个流程。一个会话是它自己的不透明句柄，而不是一个电机寄存"
"器——没有东西可以逐 tick 读，只有一个要喂的窗口和一个要问的答案——而 `"
"finish()` 返回 `FOC_OK` 且 `valid == 0` 是拒绝，不是失败。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:304 872d883b2ccf4c69b7ed26beb65cd884
msgid ""
"`Param` for a non-positive `kt`, `j_expected`, `bandwidth` or `i_max`, a "
"negative `b_expected`, a non-positive tolerance or residual bound, and a "
"window shorter than three samples. `State`-shaped refusals arrive as "
"`valid == false` with a reason: too short a window, a saturated period, a"
" current that never varied, a residual above the bound, a negative "
"mechanical pole, and a measured inertia outside the tolerance."
msgstr ""
"`kt` 、 `j_expected` 、 `bandwidth` 或 `i_max` 非正， `b_expected` 为负"
"，容差或残差界非正，窗口短于三个样本时返回 `Param` 。 `State` 形态的拒绝"
"以 `valid == false` 加一条理由到达：窗口过短、周期饱和、电流从未变化、残"
"差高于界、机械极点为负、实测惯量超出容差。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:308 d9ad03a0657342d79138e3a256baf657
msgid "``AutoTune.ADoubledInertiaIsRefusedAndTheGainsComeBackUntouched``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``AutoTune.ADoubledInertiaIsRefusedAndTheGainsComeBackUntouched``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:309 00f2a9b3f41b4966af980d404db83ff5
msgid ""
"na -- the window is a finite sum that is thrown away on `reset()`, and "
"what leaves the class is a `Pi` config rather than a per-tick output."
msgstr ""
"na ——窗口是有限样本的求和，在 `reset()` 时被丢弃；离开这个类的是一个 `Pi"
"` 配置，而不是逐 tick 的输出。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:312 341e2f1b1c374c39aa8ceb8db166eb79
msgid "``comm/frame.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``comm/frame.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:313 5c21f4be075b46e3a4501814f61e8286
msgid ""
"`FrameStatus` names which check failed (start / length / checksum) "
"instead of one generic failure, and `SequenceChecker` reports `missing` /"
" `duplicate` / `out_of_order` separately. `missing` counts the frames "
"between the one expected and the one that arrived, so a single skipped "
"frame reports 1."
msgstr ""
"`FrameStatus` 指明是哪一项检查失败（起始 / 长度 / 校验和），而不是一个笼"
"统的失败； `SequenceChecker` 分别报告 `missing` / `duplicate` / `"
"out_of_order` 。 `missing` 统计的是期望的那一帧与实际到达的那一帧之间的"
"帧数，所以只跳过一帧时报 1。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:316 a41f087ad72747f8aea0395a9f44b9e2
msgid ""
"`encode_frame` returns 0 and writes nothing when the frame does not fit; "
"`decode_frame` refuses a short buffer, a late start byte and an over-long"
" length before touching the receiver."
msgstr ""
"帧放不下时 `encode_frame` 返回 0 且不写任何东西； `decode_frame` 在触碰"
"接收方之前就拒绝过短的缓冲区、迟到的起始字节与过长的长度。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:318 79003c6b2b49459b80e090a089e294c3
msgid "``Frame.NoSingleByteCorruptionIsAccepted``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``Frame.NoSingleByteCorruptionIsAccepted``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:319 d669d1728eb04a068163c5fdc69d2f71
msgid ""
"na -- the codec holds no state; `SequenceChecker` holds one byte and one "
"flag, and neither is a continuous-output invariant."
msgstr ""
"na ——编解码器不持有状态； `SequenceChecker` 持有一个字节和一个标志，两者"
"都不是连续输出上的不变量。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:322 8a7bae196b7e486faa5b89a5dda6d36f
msgid "``comm/encoder_stream.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``comm/encoder_stream.hpp`` （编码器数据流）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:323 9b435d25de284fc284aca77137a1431a
msgid ""
"`EncoderFrame` separates \"this frame arrived and is not trustworthy\" "
"(`State` plus `crc_ok == false`, with the counts still filled in so a log"
" has something to show) from \"this buffer cannot be read at all\" "
"(`Param`, with no value handed back). `TurnAssembler::Step` separates a "
"wrap from a gap: `jumped == true` means the travel was unknowable, and "
"then `unwrapped` does **not** move."
msgstr ""
"`EncoderFrame` 把“这一帧到了，但不可信”（ `State` 加 `crc_ok == false` "
"，各计数仍然填好，好让日志有东西可看）与“这个缓冲区根本读不了”（ `Param`"
" ，不交回任何值）分开。 `TurnAssembler::Step` 把过零回卷与断档分开： `"
"jumped== true` 意味着行程不可知，此时 `unwrapped` **不** 移动。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:327 2342d27366ab4cec8477bc56830baff2
msgid ""
"`Param` for a null buffer, a stream whose length is not `frame_bits()`, a"
" layout with 0 single-turn bits, more than 31 single-turn bits, more than"
" 32 data bits, or negative multi-turn bits; and for an assembler whose "
"single-turn bits are outside `1..31` or whose declared maximum step is 0 "
"or above half a turn (above which the wrap question is undecidable). "
"`State` for a CRC mismatch, a failed-CRC frame fed to the assembler, or a"
" gap."
msgstr ""
"空缓冲区、长度不等于 `frame_bits()` 的数据流、单圈位数为 0 的布局、单圈"
"位数超过 31、数据位超过 32、多圈位数为负时返回 `Param` ；单圈位数落在 `"
"1..31` 之外、或声明的最大步长等于 0 或达到半圈以上（超过半圈时回卷问题不"
"可判定）的拼装器亦然。CRC 不匹配、把 CRC 失败的帧喂给拼装器、或出现断档"
"时返回 `State` 。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:331 7333c3e50c3547bfa0f54fd80806f84c
msgid "``EncoderStream.TheLengthIsRefusedAndAShiftIsTheFramingLayersProblemNotTheCrc``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"EncoderStream.TheLengthIsRefusedAndAShiftIsTheFramingLayersProblemNotTheCrc"
"``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:332 d1fc51e161604487930de2d516436086
msgid ""
"na -- the decoder is a pure function of one frame, and the assembler "
"holds one previous count and one origin, neither of which is a "
"continuous-output invariant."
msgstr ""
"na ——解码器是单帧的纯函数；拼装器持有一个上一次的计数与一个原点，两者都"
"不是连续输出上的不变量。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:335 555c5ca5273542b9aadbcce5daeaa1fb
msgid "``comm/register_map.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``comm/register_map.hpp`` （寄存器映射）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:336 9a8e565354b64ea0885dbf4a01369700
msgid ""
"`read_register()` answers one 32-bit word per register; `RegisterKind` "
"says whether to read it as an unsigned count, a signed code, or IEEE-754 "
"bits."
msgstr ""
"`read_register()` 每个寄存器返回一个 32 位字； `RegisterKind` 说明该把它"
"读成无符号计数、有符号码值，还是 IEEE-754 位。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:338 280bb96acc1a40ba9a46961201f11745
msgid ""
"a NULL receiver, an id with no row, and any register whose C function "
"refuses all return `false` **with the word untouched** -- except the two "
"count registers, whose C functions document NULL as 0."
msgstr ""
"接收者为 NULL、id 没有对应行、以及 C 函数拒绝的任何一个寄存器，都返回 `"
"false` ，且 **字保持不变** ——例外是两个计数寄存器，它们的 C 函数把 NULL"
"记为 0。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:340 39c0b07e2ac44cab99b717cffa4799db
msgid "``RegisterMap.ARefusedReadLeavesTheWordAloneAndTheTwoKindsOfAnswerStayDifferent``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"RegisterMap.ARefusedReadLeavesTheWordAloneAndTheTwoKindsOfAnswerStayDifferent"
"``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:341 f803c59cfa5f4f6cb93da822fa18613e
msgid "na -- read-only and idempotent; nothing here accumulates."
msgstr ""
"na ——只读且幂等；这里没有任何量累积。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:343 ce57282fd9794524b5156bb240864175
msgid "``core/trace_parse.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/trace_parse.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:344 2df8dc0675de461794610191c776f529
msgid ""
"`missing` (inferred inside the window), `lost` (declared before it), "
"`gaps`, `reversals`, `segments`, and `complete` only when nothing is "
"missing either way. `consistent` is the parser's own check: `missing` is "
"counted twice, by summing the per-pair skips and from the two endpoint "
"timestamps."
msgstr ""
"`missing` （在窗口内推断出来的）、 `lost` （在窗口之前声明的）、 `gaps` "
"、 `reversals` 、 `segments` ，以及只有在两个方向上都不缺任何东西时才为"
"真的 `complete` 。 `consistent` 是解析器自身的检查： `missing` 被算了两"
"遍，一遍把逐对的跳数相加，一遍由两个端点时间戳算出。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:347 c77da98dfbaf40caa59864beae941650
msgid ""
"`Param` for a zero period or a span whose samples pointer does not match "
"its size; a window with no clock reports `timed == false` rather than a "
"fabricated consistency."
msgstr ""
"周期为零、或跨度上样本指针与其尺寸不符时返回 `Param` ；没有时钟的窗口报 "
"`timed == false` ，而不是编造一个一致性结论。"

