"na ——主机侧工具，不是控制路径上的组件；调用之间不持有状态。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:352 cc08bb66c39342858f88ac787ea3e165
msgid "``core/six_step.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/six_step.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:353 b5da28d6a38447c9881e9100a9f32df4
msgid ""
"`sector`, `changed`, `holding` and `skipped`, plus "
"`rejected()`/`illegal()` counters. `holding` and `skipped` are different "
"things and the duty alone cannot tell them apart: one means the pins "
"named no position, the other means they named one the rotor cannot have "
"reached."
msgstr ""
"`sector` 、 `changed` 、 `holding` 与 `skipped` ，另加 `rejected()` /`"
"illegal()` 计数。 `holding` 与 `skipped` 是两回事，只看占空比分辨不出来"
"：一个表示引脚没有指明任何位置，另一个表示它们指明的那个位置转子不可能到"
"达。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:356 7b6c1903205c46c7ae646a2ee95ca53d
msgid ""
"`Param` for an amplitude outside `(0, 1]` or a step allowance outside "
"`1..5` -- a table driven at zero amplitude produces no torque while "
"looking like it is running."
msgstr ""
"幅值落在 `(0, 1]` 之外、或步进允许值落在 `1..5` 之外时返回 `Param` ——以"
"零幅值驱动的换相表不产生转矩，看起来却像在转。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:358 3c29442800e6448d8a9cfd0e8044d0c6
msgid "``SixStep.WalkingTheSectorsTurnsTheVectorSixtyDegreesEach``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``SixStep.WalkingTheSectorsTurnsTheVectorSixtyDegreesEach``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:359 78d5604b7bce4ea196411a8fc77e0df8
msgid ""
"na -- each call maps a code to a vector; the state it keeps is the last "
"accepted sector, which is the boundary case above rather than a "
"continuous-output invariant."
msgstr ""
"na ——每次调用把一个码映射成一个矢量；它保留的状态是最后被接受的扇区，那"
"是上面的边界用例，而不是连续输出上的不变量。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:362 27f160fe56544765b6a1d58739b0747c
msgid "``core/command_source.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/command_source.hpp`` （指令源）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:363 1d38b34d30d140cabc48b1b3a393770f
msgid ""
"`analog`: `in_deadband`; `ppm`: `valid`; `step`: `pulses`, `delta_rad` "
"and `jump`. A command source whose only output is a number cannot be told"
" apart from a dead link, and `jump` is the difference between \"the axis "
"moved\" and \"the axis moved further than one period of motion allows, so"
" a count was lost\"."
msgstr ""
"`analog` ： `in_deadband` ； `ppm` ： `valid` ； `step` ： `pulses` 、 `"
"delta_rad` 与 `jump` 。只输出一个数的指令源，与一条断掉的链路无法区分；"
"而 `jump` 区分的是“轴动了”与“轴的动程超过一个周期所允许的范围，说明丢了"
"一个计数”。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:366 e098d88330df4b0d9fd4d9b2eb52b4f1
msgid ""
"`Param` when the interface cannot be mapped exactly (`pulses_per_rev == "
"0`), when the analogue band is not below full scale, or when the pulse-"
"width window is empty or inverted. An interface that cannot be mapped "
"exactly is refused rather than approximated, because the approximation is"
" a position error that never goes away."
msgstr ""
"接口无法精确映射（ `pulses_per_rev == 0` ）、模拟量区间不低于满量程、或"
"脉宽窗口为空或反向时返回 `Param` 。无法精确映射的接口被拒绝，而不是被近"
"似，因为这种近似是永不消退的位置误差。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:369 c3a259d8698847b3b668d86d66118616
msgid "``CommandSource.AWholeTurnIsExactlyAWholeTurn``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``CommandSource.AWholeTurnIsExactlyAWholeTurn``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:370 fbbaeeaa74e7432f8b65b637fa576fe1
msgid ""
"na -- each call is a pure map from its input to a command; there is no "
"state to hold invariant across time."
msgstr ""
"na ——每次调用都是从输入到指令的纯映射；没有需要在时间上保持不变的状态。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:372 42b853deb95542958d250b40772859e6
msgid "``core/step_metrics.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/step_metrics.hpp`` （阶跃指标）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:373 6cea355379a24c95940cf1a2c08d1f39
msgid ""
"``status``, and it carries weight: ``Ok`` means a first-order decay was "
"fitted, ``State`` means the window carried none -- and the settling "
"numbers stay valid in that case, because a response can settle without "
"being fittable. A bandwidth of 0 is impossible under ``Ok``, so zero "
"cannot be mistaken for \"not measured\"."
msgstr ""
"``status`` ，而且它有分量： ``Ok`` 表示拟合出了一阶衰减， ``State`` 表示"
"窗口里没有可拟合的衰减——这种情况下稳定指标仍然有效，因为一条响应可以稳定"
"下来却不可拟合。 ``Ok`` 下带宽不可能为 0，所以零不会被误当成“没有测量”。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:376 ddf9e43e49424f81ac54d0479302708a
msgid ""
"``Param`` for a window that cannot describe a step: fewer than three "
"samples, a non-positive ``dt_s``, a negative band, or a window that does "
"not move at all (``y[0] == target``)."
msgstr ""
"无法描述一个阶跃的窗口返回 ``Param`` ：样本少于三个、 ``dt_s`` 非正、区"
"间为负，或窗口根本不动（ ``y[0] == target`` ）。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:378 33c5053956e446c2a00d27e3bca1846e
msgid "``StepMetrics.AWindowWithoutADecayReportsStateRatherThanAConfidentNumber``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"StepMetrics.AWindowWithoutADecayReportsStateRatherThanAConfidentNumber``"

