#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:382 9fa0f4ecff484b79acbd8b850966e914
msgid ""
"``status``: ``Ok`` for a conditioned fit, ``State`` when the window is "
"shorter than one period of the frequency asked about -- where a number "
"would be produced but would not be the tone's amplitude."
msgstr ""
"``status`` ：条件良好的拟合为 ``Ok`` ；窗口短于所问频率的一个周期时为 ``"
"State`` ——那里仍会算出一个数，但那不是该频率正弦的幅值。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:384 f71df3bcb90b45919f67706ba882121e
msgid ""
"``Param`` for fewer than six samples, a non-positive ``dt_s`` or "
"frequency, or a frequency at or above Nyquist, where the projection "
"aliases and reports the tone at a frequency the signal does not have."
msgstr ""
"样本少于六个、 ``dt_s`` 或频率非正、或频率达到或超过 Nyquist 时返回 ``"
"Param`` ；此时投影发生混叠，把该频率成分报到信号本身并不存在的频率上。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:386 32b9b69845aa4bb685d70a30cbbbce24
