msgid "``motor/torque_map.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``motor/torque_map.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:390 6eb0fa3897cd4d4ea35893702a5fb1b6
msgid ""
"``status`` for the map and ``limited`` for every command. The second one "
"is the point: a clipped command and an obeyed one are otherwise "
"identical, and a caller who cannot tell them apart reports a saturating "
"tensioner as holding."
msgstr ""
"``status`` 针对映射本身， ``limited`` 针对每一条指令。后一个才是要点：被"
"裁剪的指令与被执行的指令在其他方面完全相同，分不清两者的调用方会把一个已"
"经饱和的张力控制器报成“正在保持”。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:393 a31858b2fa814a69a02451df64f8882d
msgid ""
"``Param`` when the nameplate produces no torque per amp (`kt <= 0`), has "
"no pole pairs, or when the limits do not describe an interval; and "
"``Param`` from `torque_command` when the d-axis current cancels the "
"torque constant and no current can deliver the request -- a refusal, "
"because clamping would report a torque that cannot be produced."
msgstr ""
"铭牌给出的每安培转矩为零（ `kt <= 0` ）、没有极对数、或限值不构成一个区"
"间时返回 ``Param`` ；当 d 轴电流把转矩常数抵消、没有任何电流能满足该请求"
"时， `torque_command` 也返回 ``Param`` ——这是拒绝，因为钳位会报出一个根"
"本产不出来的转矩。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:396 8d307d07cd3b4b65a0c25d49197ee2d5
msgid "``TorqueMap.TheLimitsAreNarrowedToWhatTheInverterCanDeliver``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``TorqueMap.TheLimitsAreNarrowedToWhatTheInverterCanDeliver``"

