msgid "A-14"
msgstr ""
"A-14"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:399 7ba8d6f541e64969a66bc85824a36a6f
msgid "``core/stall_start.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/stall_start.hpp``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:400 012b347862bb4eddbe503a942f75c8c5
msgid ""
"``phase()`` and `limited`. \"starting\", \"released\" and \"cannot "
"start\" are three states rather than one number, and `Failed` is a first-"
"class answer: a load the drive cannot move is a fact about the machine, "
"and a sequence that ramps forever instead of saying so leaves the "
"operator watching a silent axis. Through `Motor` the same two facts are "
"`stall_start_phase()` and `stall_start_torque_nm()`, and they have to be "
"read together: the phase says whether the torque beside it is still the "
"sequence's or the caller's again."
msgstr ""
"``phase()`` 与 `limited` 。“启动中”“已释放”“无法启动”是三个状态而不是一"
"个数，而 `Failed` 是一等答案：驱动推不动的负载是关于这台电机的事实，一条"
"只会一直爬坡、却不肯把这一点说出来的序列，留下的只有操作员盯着一个沉默的"
"轴。经由 `Motor` ，同样这两件事是 `stall_start_phase()` 与 `"
"stall_start_torque_nm()` ，且必须一起读：相位说明它旁边的转矩此刻仍属于"
"这条流程，还是又回到了调用方。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:405 5e4c7d324e72483282a2143003126112
msgid ""
"``Param`` from `validate()`/`begin()` when the limit is not above the "
"breakaway point -- a sequence whose ceiling is under the breakaway can "
"only ever produce `Failed`, so accepting it would accept a recipe known "
"in advance not to work -- and when the ramp, release speed or grace "
"period is not positive. `Motor::begin_stall_start()` adds the admission "
"the sequence cannot make for itself: `State` when the axis is not running"
" or is still aligning, because a torque source has no business running "
"during a forced angle. Both refusals leave the phase `Idle` rather than "
"half-way into a ramp."
msgstr ""
"限值不高于脱开点时， `validate()` /`begin()` 返回 ``Param`` ——上限低于脱"
"开点的流程只可能产出 `Failed` ，接受它等于接受一份事先已知不灵的配方——爬"
"坡斜率、释放转速或宽限时间非正时亦然。 `Motor::begin_stall_start()` 补上"
"流程自己无法作出的准入：轴未在运行或仍在对齐时返回 `State` ，因为转矩源"
"在强制角度期间没有理由工作。两种拒绝都把相位留为 `Idle` ，而不是停在爬坡"
"中途。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:411 8460e87ceb4147d88fad544d44b323f9
msgid "``StallStart.AStuckAxisSaysFailedInsteadOfRampingForever``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``StallStart.AStuckAxisSaysFailedInsteadOfRampingForever``"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:412 833c9c4060b84fdf9e48c15e786f725d
msgid "na -- a sequencer over other capabilities, not an equation of its own."
msgstr ""
"na ——编排其他能力的序列器，自身不是一个方程。"

