#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:414 1965108bffcb4e098dbf3586420f943e
msgid "``core/observer/observer_policy.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/observer/observer_policy.hpp`` （观测器策略）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:415 977125ba3e3f4512a32cd6ca0b64a507
msgid ""
"na -- concepts: it names what an observer must provide and provides "
"nothing itself."
msgstr ""
"na ——概念：它规定观测器必须提供什么，自身不提供任何东西。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:416 31b93e37d5f84ab285819bd805687a91
msgid ""
"na -- a type either satisfies the concept or fails to compile, which is "
"the strongest admission there is."
msgstr ""
"na ——一个类型要么满足该概念，要么编译不过，这是最强的准入。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:417 5fa0555873814cc2aaed4f433bf3816d
msgid "na -- there is no runtime behaviour to bound."
msgstr ""
"na ——没有可约束的运行时行为。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:418 f1c6aac20e2844fcb1ff862157de857a
msgid "na -- there is no arithmetic here to be invariant about."
msgstr ""
"na ——这里没有可供言说不变量的运算。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:420 8845116eec5a428c9289b9f8c1192f49
msgid "``core/observer/ideal_observer.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/observer/ideal_observer.hpp`` （理想观测器）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:421 26770b7f83054372b64e8ce79337770f
msgid ""
"``reset()``, ``set_truth()`` -- a test double told the answer; it has no "
"failure mode to report."
msgstr ""
"``reset()`` 、 ``set_truth()`` ——一个被告知答案的测试替身；它没有失效模"
"式可报告。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:422 be67f12fabee4d82a24196f4340e84f6
msgid ""
"na -- it accepts whatever truth it is given, which is the whole point of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"na ——交给它什么真值它就接受什么，这正是它存在的全部意义。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:423 7d0a688a1c3c466e9064ce25429a9029
msgid ""
"na -- only the SIL harness uses it; the harness is not part of the "
"shipped library."
msgstr ""
"na ——只有 SIL 测试装置使用它；该测试装置不属于随库发布的部分。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:424 8f1845d7278a498291a4b51a365c6ac1
msgid "na -- no arithmetic beyond assigning the truth it was handed."
msgstr ""
"na ——除把交给它的真值赋上之外没有运算。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:426 da7a9f06df1f46c6af55fe58127a2653
msgid "``core/observer/back_emf_observer.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/observer/back_emf_observer.hpp`` （反电动势观测器）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:427 2fbb15f6e55c45acb85f935c050be969
msgid ""
"``state()``, ``flux()`` -- and deliberately no ``locked()``: there is no "
"channel that could withhold a verdict, so reporting one would be a "
"fiction."
msgstr ""
"``state()`` 、 ``flux()`` ——并且有意不提供 ``locked()`` ：没有任何通道能"
"扣住一个判决，所以报告这样一个量就是虚构。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:429 67539f4c99454731b25febc092968890
msgid ""
"na -- parameters arrive through ``apply_params()``; there is no "
"configuration to contradict."
msgstr ""
"na ——参数经 ``apply_params()`` 传入；没有会自相矛盾的配置。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:430 2962d1b4a35f49d0bf655f4dcf9fd1ad
msgid ""
"todo -- standstill is the obvious limit: there is no signal there. No "
"case pins it yet, and writing the row without the case is the folklore "
"the boundaries gate exists to prevent."
msgstr ""
"todo ——零速是最明显的限制：那里没有信号。目前还没有用例钉住它，而在没有"
"用例的情况下写下这一行，就是那种口口相传的说法，边界门禁存在的目的正是杜"
"绝它。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:432 a80e0dc41515423c96a551f2f41de27f
msgid "na -- a flux integration, not an algebraic identity."
msgstr ""
"na ——磁链积分，不是代数恒等式。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:434 6568e896eb1e42d6a3172d53c8e43c5c
msgid "``core/observer/dual_inductance_observer.hpp``"
msgstr ""
"``core/observer/dual_inductance_observer.hpp`` （双电感观测器）"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:435 8dfafa6983874d7191f52eac4c9a1da8
msgid ""
"``state()``, ``flux()``, ``root_gap_rad()`` -- the last is a diagnostic "
"and not an estimate: it says how far apart the two rotor positions "
"consistent with the measured flux and current are."
msgstr ""
"``state()`` 、 ``flux()`` 、 ``root_gap_rad()`` ——最后一个是诊断量而不是"
"估计量：它说明与实测磁链和电流相符的两个转子位置相距多远。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:437 290856bf864a467581e8f1c73fd49143
msgid ""
"``FluxSource::Corrected`` is admitted only with ``correction_gain`` in "
"(0, 1]; ``Integrator`` never reads the gain, so leaving it at zero is not"
" refused for a value it does not use."
msgstr ""
"``FluxSource::Corrected`` 只有在 ``correction_gain`` 落在 (0, 1] 时才被"
"准入； ``Integrator`` 从不读这个增益，所以把它留为零时，不会因为一个它并"
"不使用的值而被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:439 0d624de041ad40a386a122eec66169ee
msgid ""
"none -- measured, and the hole closes the other way round: the second "
"root of the quadratic is never a rotor position (modulus 20 to 68 against"
" 1 across `i_d` = -0.5 to -2.5 A, its angle pi away), so there is no "
"physical branch for continuity to pick wrongly; and a seed no angle "
"explains is *not* corrected -- 0.1128 rad after one step and 0.1128 after"
" 200 -- which is why `seed_at()` takes an angle rather than a guess. See "
"``DualInductanceObserver.TheSecondRootIsNotARotorPositionAndAWrongSeedIsPermanent``."
msgstr ""
"none ——已实测，而且这个洞是从另一头合上的：二次方程的第二个根从来不是转"
"子位置（在 `i_d` = -0.5 至 -2.5 A 范围内，其模为 20 到 68，而另一个根为1"
"，角度相差 pi），因此不存在连续性会挑错的物理分支；而一个没有任何角度能"
"解释的种子 *不会* 被纠正——一步之后是 0.1128 rad，200 步之后仍是 0.1128——"
"这正是 `seed_at()` 接受一个角度而不是一个猜测的原因。见 ``"
"DualInductanceObserver.TheSecondRootIsNotARotorPositionAndAWrongSeedIsPermanent"
"`` 。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:444 0a82cf74cd96454ba7d1be58c4821476
msgid "na -- one complex square root and one quadratic, evaluated pointwise."
msgstr ""
"na ——一个复数平方根和一个二次方程，逐点求值。"

