#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:449 c23a7f28b4d14deba6e1c41c1d1c3452
msgid ""
"none -- the mode is admitted on facts about the machine, and its "
"estimate's sensitivity to those facts is measured rather than assumed."
msgstr ""
"none ——该模式依据关于这台电机的事实被准入，其估计对这些事实的敏感性是测"
"出来的，不是假定的。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:451 e68ed2544105460bbed7c99b51545d3d
