#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:454 23216f7b20574fb3a97d7985a406fb04
msgid ""
"``locked()``, ``error()``, ``hf_current_a()``, ``status()`` -- the error "
"signal is the demodulated quantity, so \"no measurement\" and \"zero "
"error\" are distinguishable numbers."
msgstr ""
"``locked()`` 、 ``error()`` 、 ``hf_current_a()`` 、 ``status()`` ——误差"
"信号就是解调出来的那个量，所以“没有测量”与“误差为零”是两个可区分的数。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:456 a81a84edc8ac4b0aa5608c6aea8e82f6
msgid ""
