#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:469 507b86b5c7b248b1b86dca6fc2e78ad8
msgid ""
"``kind()``, ``locked()``, ``error()``, ``injection_ab()`` -- the slot "
"reports which mode is really running and what that mode is measuring, so "
"a refused request cannot masquerade as a switch."
msgstr ""
"``kind()`` 、 ``locked()`` 、 ``error()`` 、 ``injection_ab()`` ——这个槽"
"位报告实际在跑的是哪个模式、该模式在测什么，所以被拒绝的请求无法冒充成一"
"次切换。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:471 d0b1ef94f46042658a1bca8cd8467622
msgid ""
"``hand_over_to()`` answers ``ErrorCode::State`` outside ``Run``, and "
"``ErrorCode::Param`` when the setup in force cannot support the requested"
" mode; ``set_kind()`` is the compile-time-only path."
msgstr ""
"``hand_over_to()`` 在 ``Run`` 之外返回 ``ErrorCode::State`` ，现行配置无"
"法支撑所请求的模式时返回 ``ErrorCode::Param`` ； ``set_kind()`` 是仅编译"
"期的路径。"

