#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:477 de0469101c674273950714c29bd22874
msgid ""
"``status()`` (mode, fault, observer, locked), ``error()``, ``trace()`` --"
" the composed loop answers \"is it running, what is it commutating on, "
"what has it recorded\", so a wrong angle is a named mode rather than a "
"symptom. ``trace()`` is what makes the loop's own decisions auditable "
"after the fact."
msgstr ""
"``status()`` （模式、故障、观测器、锁定）、 ``error()`` 、 ``trace()`` —"
"—这个组装起来的环路回答“它在转吗、它在靠什么换相、它记下了什么”，于是角"
"度错了会表现为一个有名字的模式，而不是一个症状。 ``trace()`` 正是让环路"
"自己的决策在事后可被审计的东西。"

#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:480 5e41e3318a2e4fe1b6db59d5a4d63f02
msgid ""
"``init()`` answers ``ErrorCode::Param`` on a contradictory configuration "
"and ``set_observer()`` refuses a mode the setup in force cannot support "
"-- on facts (no carrier, no saliency), not on a switch."
msgstr ""
"``init()`` 在配置自相矛盾时返回 ``ErrorCode::Param`` ； ``set_observer()"
"`` 拒绝现行配置无法支撑的模式——依据的是事实（没有载波、没有凸极性），而"
"不是某个开关。"

