#: ../../source/capabilities.rst:486 6ca0d2f021e44dfe9d14712da134f48b
msgid ""
"Twenty-three headers under ``core/`` and ``motor/`` are not listed yet: "
"alignment, board_check, commissioning, deadtime, feedforward, "
"field_weakening, homing, machine_map, machine_map_text, machine_params, "
"motion_profile, polarity, position, position_reference, reference, sm, "
"startup, svpwm, traits, types, version, and the two remaining ``motor/`` "
"headers. They are named in ``capability-scope.json`` so the count is "
"visible, and so that a *new* header cannot join them silently."
msgstr ""
"``core/`` 与 ``motor/`` 下还有二十三个头文件尚未列入：alignment、"
"board_check、commissioning、deadtime、feedforward、field_weakening、"
"homing、machine_map、machine_map_text、machine_params、motion_profile、"
"polarity、position、position_reference、reference、sm、startup、svpwm、"
"traits、types、version，以及 ``motor/`` 下剩下的两个。它们在 ``"
"capability-scope.json`` 中被点名，好让数量可见，也使一个 *新* 头文件无法"
"悄悄加入这个名单。"

